---
import { BUSINESS_HREF, HOW_IT_WORKS_HREF } from '../../lib/home';
---

<section class="not-prose" id="company-formation">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 md:py-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-slate-50 shadow-none dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900">
      <div class="grid items-center lg:grid-cols-12">
        <div class="p-8 md:p-12 lg:col-span-7">
          <p class="mb-3 text-base font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-primary">International business</p>
          <h2 class="font-heading mb-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl dark:text-white">
            Your ambitions don't have to stop at borders.
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted dark:text-slate-400">
            Whether you're launching a new company, expanding an existing business or exploring an international
            structure, the first step is understanding the process.
          </p>
          <p class="mb-8 text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200">
            Company Formation • Documentation • International Expansion
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row">
            <a href={BUSINESS_HREF} class="btn-primary">Explore Business Registration</a>
            <a href={HOW_IT_WORKS_HREF} class="btn">See How It Works</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hidden items-center justify-center p-8 lg:col-span-5 lg:flex">
          <img
            src="/assets/hubs/company-registration.svg"
            alt=""
            class="h-56 w-56 rounded-lg object-cover"
            width="224"
            height="224"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
